  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This early action project is being proposed for Sarishabari sub-district under Jamalpur district targeting flood vulnerable communities. Like other early action projects, activities under this project are also expected to strengthen the targeted community&#x2019;s resilience to cope with disaster. Categorically, interventions proposed under this project are expected to have impact over Food Security, Disaster Risk Reduction, and cash.</narrative>
